{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"2c2da259ac0c91776d9f9afaa8c9159e63d104e9caf70e664468946236973489","ja":"可奈の新商品のチョコレートCMが流れるようになって、\n1週間ほどたったある日……","zh":"可奈的新商品巧克力广告开播\n约1周后的某一天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ebe4aec8188b9f836e1c6884190d28e648d64747e8e7aac21977fdf7227a8f82","ja":"はぁ～……。","zh":"唉～……。","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ff73cc2ff9b38bb02ebe0c31b089c6477ef9ba5602531a2e8cc5c61d3528003c","ja":"矢吹さん？　どうかされ……ええっ！？","zh":"矢吹小姐？你怎么了……诶诶！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a68035d24bd33642502838b8d31101d565c1faae6db0767dd0c5e6d2c150aa7b","ja":"わぁ～。またチョコレートがいっぱいだねぇ。\nこの前より、もっとすごいべさぁ。","zh":"哇～。又有好多巧克力呢。\n比上次还要更厉害呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"160123214bbe7c698e9d512e4cf8adc32a3ece0e05d514bdb27b0a9145a91602","ja":"第2弾のCMも好評だと聞いていたのですが……\nそのお礼、でしょうか？","zh":"听说第2弹广告的反响也很不错……\n这是为此表达的谢意吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"6909a653160b25f09cf47e4ab41ef95855c8aa0753be8826b3b30c53ded7c76e","ja":"いえ、実は……\nまた新しいお仕事をいただいちゃったんです！","zh":"不，其实是……\n我又接到了新工作！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"8c82d8f600f684bae57d068bf1f10e467f4d8468d25f34083038665cb346b07c","ja":"「今度は新商品の開発から参加してほしい」って、\n試食用にたくさん送られてきちゃって……！","zh":"对方说“下次希望能从新商品的研发阶段就参与进来”，\n结果寄来了好多试吃品……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"379d1293f3b91fcce7efb2480673dd4defc10dc0954e61cebc994fa18e86bf73","ja":"それじゃあ、ここにあるチョコ、\n全種類食べ比べしないといけない、ってことかい？","zh":"那么，也就是说这里所有的巧克力，\n我都得尝个遍才行吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"00657858ac3e119b91600a58f796e6457487860c711aee79aa472ea484bbbdef","ja":"そう、ですね……。開発会議に参加するのでしたら、\nすべての味は知っておかないと……。","zh":"说、说的也是呢……如果要参加开发会议的话，\n所有口味都得先了解一下才行……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"629450daf40a8a2c028cac57ce6c50f39687a4741233c40bfdf2b7af754e34a1","ja":"うぅ……チョコをいっぱい食べられるのは\n幸せですけど……。","zh":"唔……虽然能吃很多巧克力\n是很幸福啦……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"95af2f49f1e8cac98246650d4a029700bb79b201db90bb762b90ca5272692d67","ja":"も～っと運動して、も～っと食べ方に気をつけないと\nいけないですよね……。","zh":"必须更～多地运动，在饮食方面也必须\n更～加注意才行呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"ed10e48135d9134e5363e7b53b57adb4ba9fb53db8f3b9122f199f674709fe0c","ja":"な、なんだか、頭がパンクしちゃいそうです～！","zh":"总、总觉得脑袋快要爆炸了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"3de2ae8e30532efde560d2a3a739374c9381457fcc6df87040664b90ba3a14ff","ja":"なまら大変そうだねぇ。\nけど、こればっかりはしかたないかも……。","zh":"看起来挺不容易的呢。\n不过，唯独这件事可能也是没办法的吧……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1662.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"7c46f50f9c956d1f23c6dd334e2edbd4b0bf400cd89ce9d3688484d5fe137614","ja":"せめて、残った分は私達でいただきますので。\n矢吹さん……ご健闘をお祈りします！","zh":"至少，剩下的部分就由我们吃掉吧。\n矢吹同学……祝你奋战到底！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
